{"about_the_game":"Immerse yourself in a magical 2D world with thousands of online players in this MMORPG!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n* Factions<br />\r\nChoose a side in this great story! Fight with the Draxian nobles or the ferocious Naru.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n* PvP<br />\r\nFight other players in this open world or compete in the world ranking to get fabulous prizes or rewards!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n*Exploration<br />\r\nExplore a huge open world full of magic and adventures to reveal. Meet new friends on your own adventure!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n* Professiones<br />\r\nChoose between 3 professions: mining, elementalism and jewelry.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n*Enchantment<br />\r\nUpgrade your items by enchanting them to make them unique.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n*Commerce<br />\r\nMake exchanges with other players to get items, materials, minerals and even pets!<br />\r\nSearch for that item that you love it in the Auction House!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n*Emotes<br />\r\nReact with emotes to have fun with other friends in game.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHistory:<br />\r\nRecent military encounters have unleashed a new war between the Draxian and the Naru.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nJoin the noble draxian warriors, those who fight for justice and order.<br />\r\nOr fight alongside the ancestral Naru tribe, defending nature and balance in the universe.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCreate new friends and play with thousands of people online!","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1050280?t=1754528182","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1050280/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1754528182","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1050280/b97a237d9887b66c90eb862d4adf552bb3926ec1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754528182","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1050280/b97a237d9887b66c90eb862d4adf552bb3926ec1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754528182","categories":[{"description":"Mu